Read XLSX cell "Summary!B2" as site name
Expect site_name equals "Solar Site Alpha" as "site-name"

Read XLSX cell "Summary!B4" as credit value
Expect credit_value equals 250000 as "credit-value"

Read XLSX cell "Inputs!C8" as domestic content value
Expect domestic_content_value is present as "domestic-content-present"

Read XLSX cell "Inputs!C9" as error check
Expect error_check is not spreadsheet error as "no-error-value"

Export assertions to assertion report path
